I have received the following request from Frenchman Remi Bezeau.  I 
have to use machine translation for the limited amount of French 
correspondence I've done, and I'm not sure what if any resources exist 
these days for Francophones. (I know that we have an old brochure in 
French, but am not sure what else).

Can some French-competent Lojbanist correspond with Remi, and provide 
whatever assistance we are capable of?  (Please tell me you are doing 
so, so that I know the request has been responded to.)

Remi's address is:

bezeau.remi@neuf.fr

> je souhaiterai avoir de la documentation sur le lojban en francais cette langue m'interesse je souhaiterai l'apprendre et connaitre d'autre francais qui le parle et prendre part a ce grand projet
> merci par avance 


